{
  "$schema": "https://emdashcms.com/seed.schema.json",
  "version": "1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Sylee Newsletter",
    "description": "A monochrome, issue-driven newsletter theme inspired by sylee.dev/newsletter.",
    "author": "Shih-Yung Lee"
  },
  "settings": {
    "title": "網路黑手的呢喃",
    "tagline": "關於科技、開源、網路世界的不定期電子報",
    "postsPerPage": 7,
    "dateFormat": "MMM d, yyyy"
  },
  "collections": [
    {
      "slug": "posts",
      "label": "Issues",
      "labelSingular": "Issue",
      "description": "Newsletter issues rendered at /newsletter/[slug].",
      "icon": "newspaper",
      "supports": ["drafts", "revisions", "search"],
      "fields": [
        { "slug": "title", "label": "Title", "type": "string", "required": true },
        { "slug": "featured_image", "label": "Featured Image", "type": "image" },
        { "slug": "content", "label": "Content", "type": "portableText" },
        { "slug": "excerpt", "label": "Excerpt", "type": "text" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "pages",
      "label": "Pages",
      "labelSingular": "Page",
      "description": "Standalone pages.",
      "icon": "file-text",
      "supports": ["drafts", "revisions", "search"],
      "fields": [
        { "slug": "title", "label": "Title", "type": "string", "required": true },
        { "slug": "content", "label": "Content", "type": "portableText" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "taxonomies": [
    {
      "name": "category",
      "label": "Categories",
      "labelSingular": "Category",
      "hierarchical": true,
      "collections": ["posts"],
      "terms": [
        { "slug": "newsletter", "label": "Newsletter" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "tag",
      "label": "Tags",
      "labelSingular": "Tag",
      "hierarchical": false,
      "collections": ["posts"],
      "terms": [
        { "slug": "newsletter", "label": "Newsletter" },
        { "slug": "cloudflare", "label": "Cloudflare" },
        { "slug": "open-source", "label": "Open Source" },
        { "slug": "ai", "label": "AI" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bylines": [
    {
      "id": "author",
      "slug": "author",
      "displayName": "Author",
      "bio": "Newsletter author"
    }
  ],
  "menus": [
    {
      "name": "primary",
      "label": "Primary Navigation",
      "items": [
        { "type": "custom", "label": "Issues", "url": "/newsletter" },
        { "type": "custom", "label": "Search", "url": "/search" },
        { "type": "custom", "label": "RSS", "url": "/rss.xml" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "About",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "This theme is built for issue-driven writing: a big monochrome masthead, date-first archive rows, and clean long-form reading pages." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "posts": [
      {
        "id": "issue-72",
        "slug": "whispers-of-network-tinkerer-72",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "網路黑手的呢喃 - #72",
          "excerpt": "一個以科技、開源與網路文化為中心的 issue 範例。",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "這是一篇示範 issue。版面刻意保留大量空白、粗黑標題與簡潔的列表節奏，適合長期累積型 newsletter。" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "新的工具與舊的習慣" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "技術工具會一直變，但寫作真正需要的是穩定的節奏與可長期維護的內容模型。" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "embed",
              "_key": "sample-youtube",
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ",
              "provider": "youtube",
              "caption": "Sample YouTube embed"
            }
          ]
        },
        "bylines": [{ "byline": "author" }],
        "taxonomies": {
          "category": ["newsletter"],
          "tag": ["newsletter", "ai"]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "issue-71",
        "slug": "whispers-of-network-tinkerer-71",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "無人車的未來？ - #71",
          "excerpt": "雖然自動駕駛在近年來已經不算是什麼神奇的功能，但要做到完整自動駕駛各家廠商都還在努力中。",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "Cybercab 正夯" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "這裡展示一個 X/Twitter socialEmbed block。實際內容匯入時，migration script 會把貼文網址轉成相同結構。" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "socialEmbed",
              "_key": "sample-twitter",
              "platform": "twitter",
              "url": "https://x.com/JoeTegtmeyer/status/1861819915822371093",
              "title": "X/Twitter post"
            }
          ]
        },
        "bylines": [{ "byline": "author" }],
        "taxonomies": {
          "category": ["newsletter"],
          "tag": ["newsletter", "ai"]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "issue-70",
        "slug": "whispers-of-network-tinkerer-70",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "最近湧出不少 AI 相關的想法 - #70",
          "excerpt": "AI 相關工具與服務快速演進，值得用長期觀察的角度記錄下來。",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                { "_type": "span", "text": "這個 sample issue 用來展示 archive list 上的標題、摘要與 tag 呈現。" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "bylines": [{ "byline": "author" }],
        "taxonomies": {
          "category": ["newsletter"],
          "tag": ["newsletter", "open-source", "ai"]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
